{"id":"valeur","lemma":"valeur","pos":"noun","rank":1160,"glosses":["value, worth","valor, gallantry","quality, character"],"ipa":"/va.lœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/db/Fr-valeur.ogg/Fr-valeur.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"valeurs"},"formAudio":{"valeurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-valeurs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est de grande valeur.","en":"It is of great value.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null]},{"text":"Son opinion est sans valeur.","en":"His opinion is worthless.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"opinion"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Nous n'avons pas les mêmes valeurs.","en":"We don't have the same values.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"same","l":"même"},null]},{"text":"Cet article n'a aucune valeur.","en":"This article is of no value.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"article"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]},{"text":"Ces pièces ont peu de valeur.","en":"These coins are of little value.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"room in a house, etc.","l":"pièce"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"little, not much"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}